{"id":"vod_lz_86125","vodId":"86125","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"足球骑士","name_cn":"足球骑士","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20240403-1/cee3c3c15f9c73d69c9e9282c2cfecf5.jpg"},"summary":"逢泽驱（三瓶由布子 配音）和逢泽杰（福山润 配音）是血浓于水的亲兄弟，两人之间的感情非常的要好。阿杰拥有着杰出的运动天赋，是日本少年队里的王牌选手。阿驱虽然也对足球有着非凡的热爱，但童年时代的经历让他不愿意在别人的注视下踢球，而是选择在夜晚无人的公园里反复练习。　　升入高中后，阿杰顺理成章的加入了足球部，而阿驱则成为了足球部的经理，以左膀右臂的身份支持着哥哥。在一场严重的交通事故中，阿杰和阿驱双双身受重伤，在这性命攸关的紧要关头，为了救弟弟，阿杰选择将自己的心脏移植给了阿驱，从此之后，阿驱背负上了阿杰的遗志。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-04-03 19:21:00","playable":true,"episodeCount":37,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240331/25164_3401dac4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240331/25165_f508e4b7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240331/25166_451391ab/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240331/25168_ab932f65/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240331/25167_28047a5b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240331/25173_b0252181/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240331/25171_b29f6d38/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240331/25170_e1d6143c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240331/25172_c6feaadb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240331/25169_ab872aea/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240331/25174_388d5ee2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240331/25176_d059f900/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240331/25175_9506ee22/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240331/25177_5ca23fdb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240331/25178_54fbfa08/index.m3u8"},{"n